  "summary": "EPIC - SOFTWARE DEVELOPMENT (2012 – Present) |  Verona, WI\t\t\t\t\t         \nSoftware Developer  \t\t\t                      \t\t\t\t\t            2017 – Present \n\nIntegrated third party data with proprietary software, developed internal full stack solutions, and analyzed and developed specifications for requests for proposals.\n•\tOwner of web service integration for my team with a third party based internationally.\n•\tDeveloped integration for third party imports into a cross-application user-facing directory.\n•\tAnalyzed legally mandated international specifications for repository integration.\n\nBID Services\t  \t\t\t\t                      \t\t\t\t\t2015 – 2017\nContracted with customers to write SQL reports across the spectrum of healthcare domains, from clinical to financial, to meet individual end-user needs as well as regulatory data extract requirements for customers in the United States and in Canada. Traveled as often as bi-weekly for several customers and worked remotely for others based on their preference.\n\nReporting Engineer\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t2012 – 2015\nInterpreted specifications, designed and developed metrics for regulatory health care legal requirements. Designed ambulatory as well as medical imaging software solutions for reporting using a variety of technologies. Extensive focus on data integrity, performance, and transparency.",
